Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:42.85,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}おはようも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.12,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}バイバイ…
