Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.92,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}我的心扑通扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:37.89,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}跳个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:41.06,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}让我有些不知所措
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:42.85,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}早安的问候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.12,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}和道别的…
