Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:33.89,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}あなたに会えて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:36.97,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}胸の高鳴りが
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.40,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}止まなくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:42.40,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}ちょっとこまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.39,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}おはようも　バイバイも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.16,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}何でもない夜も
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:53.07,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}あなたのことを考えちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.61,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}少し背が伸びたんだとか
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:59.37,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}同じノートだねだとか
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:03.63,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}隣であなたともっと話したい
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:11.25,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}でもまだまだ 素直になれないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:19.04,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}声を聴いた時とか 目の前キラキラするの
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:23.77,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}忘れられない　あなたのこと
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:27.13,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}伝えたいことはひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:29.65,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}目を見て言いたいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:33.86,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}あなたのことが
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.10,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}好きだから
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:33.89,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}在遇到你的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:36.97,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}我的心扑通扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.40,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}跳个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:42.40,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}让我有些不知所措
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.39,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}早安的问候  和道别的再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.16,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}就连无事发生的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:53.07,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}一直都在想着你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.61,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}身高是不是高了点之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:59.37,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}用的笔记本是同款啊之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:03.63,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}之前那次谢谢你啦之类的想这么和你说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:11.25,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}但是我  还是  还是  还是没办法坦率起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:19.04,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}听到你的声音时  我的眼神就会变得充满活力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:23.77,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}你的一切都令我难以忘怀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:27.13,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}我想要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:29.65,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}看着你的眼睛对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:33.86,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}因为我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.10,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}喜欢你啊
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——IN3——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:57.85,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭粗黑_GBK\fs45\bord3\fad(0,714)\c&HF96A50&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(633.6,356.667)}巴士飞不上月球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:07.14,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}特別な人間じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:10.23,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}自覚してるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:15.66,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}だからこそ君との会話を
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:17.62,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}わざとらしく
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:21.09,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}そっけなくしては
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:07.14,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}我并不是什么特别的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:10.23,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}我有自知之明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:15.66,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}正因如此才与你的交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:17.62,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}故意装作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:21.09,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3c&HF96A50&}对你那么冷淡
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——IN4——
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.21,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}宇宙の真ん中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.17,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}ここだけにある
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.45,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}僕らだけの理由が
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.82,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}走り出す　走り出す
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.51,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}名前もない
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:19.04,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}胸の温度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:24.32,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}僕らの世界よ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.21,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}在宇宙的正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.17,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}唯有此处才存在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.45,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}那独属于我们的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.82,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}奔跑起来  全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.51,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}那无法命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:19.04,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}胸口的热度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:24.32,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}就是我们的世界啊
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——IN5——
